<title>CHINA: SOCCER - RESULTS OF THE CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - RESULTS OF THE CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are results of the</p>
<p>seventh round of China soccer league games played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing     4    August First	 0</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong	 2    Vanguard Huandao   1</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	  2    Guangdong Hongyuan 0</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an	 2    Qingdong Hainiu    0</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo     1    Dalian Wanda	 1</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua     0    Tianjin Samsung    0</p>
</text>
